# Step 12 — Minimal MCP Apps Demo
#
# Runs without auth out of the box (so you can poke at the App UI in
# Claude Desktop / Cursor without setting up a tenant). To add auth, copy
# the relevant block from steps 08 (Duke OIDC), 09/10 (Azure OAuth), or
# 11 (Azure + OBO) into server.py and pass `auth=auth` to FastMCP(...).

# No env vars are required for the default unauthenticated demo.
